{
  "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>롯데월드타워 — 빛의 첨탑</title>\n<style>\n  :root { --ink:#0b0e14; --paper:#f4efe6; --accent:#e8a33d; }\n  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }\n  body { background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); font-family:\"Noto Sans KR\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif; }\n  header { padding:28px 36px 10px; }\n  h1 { font-size:34px; letter-spacing:2px; font-weight:300; }\n  h1 b { color:var(--accent); font-weight:600; }\n  .sub { font-size:19px; color:#9aa3b2; margin-top:6px; }\n  .stage-wrap { display:flex; gap:24px; align-items:stretch; padding:0 36px; }\n  #stage { flex:1; min-width:0; border:1px solid #2a3142; border-radius:10px; background:#0d111c; position:relative; }\n  canvas { display:block; width:100%; height:560px; border-radius:10px; }\n  .hud { position:absolute; left:16px; top:14px; font-size:19px; color:#c8d0dd; background:rgba(11,14,20,.72); padding:8px 14px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #2a3142; }\n  .hud span { color:var(--accent); }\n  aside { width:340px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; }\n  .panel { background:#121724; border:1px solid #2a3142; border-radius:10px; padding:18px 20px; }\n  .panel h2 { font-size:20px; color:var(--accent); margin-bottom:10px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1px; }\n  .panel p, .panel li { font-size:19px; line-height:1.55; color:#dfe4ec; }\n  .panel ul { list-style:none; }\n  .panel li { padding:6px 0; border-bottom:1px dashed #2a3142; }\n  .panel li:last-child { border-bottom:none; }\n  .panel li b { color:var(--accent); font-weight:600; }\n  .controls { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; }\n  button { font-size:19px; padding:10px 16px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #3a4356; background:#1a2130; color:var(--paper); cursor:pointer; transition:background .2s; }\n  button:hover { background:#242e42; }\n  button.on { background:var(--accent); color:var(--ink); border-color:var(--accent); font-weight:600; }\n  .note { font-size:19px; color:#8b93a3; }\n  footer { padding:16px 36px 30px; font-size:19px; color:#6d7688; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n  <h1>롯데월드타워 <b>— 빛의 첨탑</b></h1>\n  <p class=\"sub\">서울 잠실의 555미터 유리 실루렛을 선과 빛의 추상으로 재구성한 인터랙티브 다이어그램</p>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"stage-wrap\">\n  <div id=\"stage\">\n    <canvas id=\"cv\" width=\"900\" height=\"560\"></canvas>\n    <div class=\"hud\">단계 <span id=\"stageNum\">1</span> / 5 — <span id=\"stageName\">기단</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <aside>\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <h2>구조 단계</h2>\n      <ul id=\"stageList\">\n        <li><b>1. 기단</b> — 12각형의 넓은 기초가 하중을 분산합니다.</li>\n        <li><b>2. 몸체</b> — 유리 커튼월이 테이퍼 곡선을 따라 좁아집니다.</li>\n        <li><b>3. 목부</b> — 단면이 급격히 축소되는 전이 구간입니다.</li>\n        <li><b>4. 첨두</b> — 봉우리 모양의 상부가 수직선을 완성합니다.</li>\n        <li><b>5. 조명</b> — 야간 미디어 파사드가 전체를 감쌉니다.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <h2>제어</h2>\n      <div class=\"controls\">\n        <button id=\"btnSpin\" class=\"on\">모형 회전</button>\n        <button id=\"btnOrbit\">시점 궤도</button>\n        <button id=\"btnPrev\">이전 단계</button>\n        <button id=\"btnNext\">다음 단계</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">드래그로 시점을 직접 조절할 수 있습니다. 회전 버튼으로 모형의 자전과 시점 궤도를 각각 멈출 수 있습니다.</p>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n</div>\n\n<footer>캔버스에 직접 그린 원근 투영 · 외부 라이브러리 없음 · 시간 측정은 performance.now 기반</footer>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  \"use strict\";\n  var cv = document.getElementById('cv'), ctx = cv.getContext('2d');\n  var W = cv.width, H = cv.height;\n  var reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n\n  // ---- geometry: profile of the tower (y from 0 base to 1 top), radius factor\n  var profile = [\n    {y:0.00, r:1.00}, {y:0.06, r:0.96}, {y:0.25, r:0.80},\n    {y:0.55, r:0.62}, {y:0.72, r:0.50}, {y:0.80, r:0.34},\n    {y:0.88, r:0.22}, {y:0.96, r:0.10}, {y:1.00, r:0.02}\n  ];\n  var SIDES = 12, TOWER_H = 420, TOWER_R = 92;\n\n  // stage definitions: which profile bands are visible + lighting\n  var stages = [\n    {name:'기단',  upTo:0.10, glow:0.0},\n    {name:'몸체',  upTo:0.72, glow:0.0},\n    {name:'목부',  upTo:0.88, glow:0.0},\n    {name:'첨두',  upTo:1.00, glow:0.0},\n    {name:'조명',  upTo:1.00, glow:1.0}\n  ];\n  var stageIdx = 0;\n\n  // motion state — reduced motion users start with everything stopped\n  var spinOn = !reduced, orbitOn = false;\n  var spinAngle = 0.6, orbitAngle = 0.35, orbitTilt = 0.42;\n  var lastT = performance.now(); // supported timing mechanism (no deprecated Clock)\n\n  function radiusAt(t){\n    for (var i=0;i<profile.length-1;i++){\n      var a=profile[i], b=profile[i+1];\n      if (t>=a.y && t<=b.y){\n        var f=(t-a.y)/(b.y-a.y);\n        return (a.r+(b.r-a.r)*f)*TOWER_R;\n      }\n    }\n    return TOWER_R*profile[profile.length-1].r;\n  }\n\n  // perspective projection\n  function project(x,y,z){\n    var cy=Math.cos(orbitAngle), sy=Math.sin(orbitAngle);\n    var x1 = x*cy - z*sy, z1 = x*sy + z*cy;\n    var ct=Math.cos(orbitTilt), st=Math.sin(orbitTilt);\n    var y1 = y*ct - z1*st, z2 = y*st + z1*ct;\n    var cam = 900, f = cam/(cam + z2 + 260);\n    return {x: W/2 + x1*f, y: H*0.86 - y1*f, f:f, z:z2};\n  }\n\n  function ringPoints(t, spin){\n    var r = radiusAt(t), pts=[];\n    for (var i=0;i<=SIDES;i++){\n      var a = spin + (i/SIDES)*Math.PI*2;\n      pts.push(project(Math.cos(a)*r, t*TOWER_H, Math.sin(a)*r));\n    }\n    return pts;\n  }\n\n  function draw(now){\n    var dt = Math.min(50, now - lastT); lastT = now;\n    if (spinOn)  spinAngle  += dt*0.00035;\n    if (orbitOn) orbitAngle += dt*0.00025;\n\n    var st = stages[stageIdx];\n    ctx.clearRect(0,0,W,H);\n\n    // backdrop gradient\n    var g = ctx.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,H);\n    g.addColorStop(0,'#0a0d16'); g.addColorStop(1,'#141b2c');\n    ctx.fillStyle=g; ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);\n\n    // ground ellipse\n    ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(120,135,160,0.35)'; ctx.lineWidth=1;\n    var gp = ringPoints(0, spinAngle);\n    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(gp[0].x,gp[0].y);\n    for (var i=1;i<gp.length;i++) ctx.lineTo(gp[i].x,gp[i].y);\n    ctx.stroke();\n\n    // vertical ribs up to stage height\n    var steps = 26;\n    for (var s=0;s<SIDES;s++){\n      var a0 = spinAngle + (s/SIDES)*Math.PI*2;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      for (var k=0;k<=steps;k++){\n        var t = (k/steps)*st.upTo;\n        var r = radiusAt(t);\n        var p = project(Math.cos(a0)*r, t*TOWER_H, Math.sin(a0)*r);\n        if (k===0) ctx.moveTo(p.x,p.y); else ctx.lineTo(p.x,p.y);\n      }\n      ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(200,212,232,0.5)';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n      ctx.stroke();\n    }\n\n    // horizontal bands\n    var bands = 14;\n    for (var b=1;b<=bands;b++){\n      var t = (b/bands)*st.upTo;\n      var pts = ringPoints(t, spinAngle);\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(pts[0].x,pts[0].y);\n      for (var j=1;j<pts.length;j++) ctx.lineTo(pts[j].x,pts[j].y);\n      var alpha = 0.25 + 0.3*(1-t);\n      if (st.glow>0) alpha += 0.3*st.glow;\n      ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba('+Math.round(150+105*st.glow)+','+Math.round(160+60*st.glow)+','+Math.round(190+40*st.glow)+','+alpha.toFixed(2)+')';\n      ctx.lineWidth = t>0.85?1:1.4;\n      ctx.stroke();\n    }\n\n    // glow wash for lighting stage\n    if (st.glow>0){\n      var top = ringPoints(st.upTo, spinAngle);\n      var cx=0, cyy=0;\n      for (var q=0;q<top.length;q++){cx+=top[q].x; cyy+=top[q].y;}\n      cx/=top.length; cyy/=top.length;\n      var rg = ctx.createRadialGradient(cx,cyy,10,cx,cyy,340);\n      rg.addColorStop(0,'rgba(232,163,61,0.35)');\n      rg.addColorStop(1,'rgba(232,163,61,0)');\n      ctx.fillStyle=rg; ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);\n    }\n\n    // beacon at top when complete\n    if (st.upTo>=1){\n      var tip = project(0, TOWER_H+14, 0);\n      ctx.fillStyle='#e8a33d';\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(tip.x,tip.y,4+2*Math.sin(now*0.004),0,Math.PI*2); ctx.fill();\n    }\n\n    requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n  }\n\n  // ---- interaction: drag to orbit manually\n  var dragging=false, px=0, py=0;\n  cv.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(e){ dragging=true; px=e.clientX; py=e.clientY; });\n  window.addEventListener('pointerup', function(){ dragging=false; });\n  window.addEventListener('pointermove', function(e){\n    if(!dragging) return;\n    orbitAngle += (e.clientX-px)*0.006;\n    orbitTilt = Math.max(0.05, Math.min(1.2, orbitTilt + (e.clientY-py)*0.004));\n    px=e.clientX; py=e.clientY;\n  });\n\n  // ---- buttons\n  var bSpin=document.getElementById('btnSpin'), bOrbit=document.getElementById('btnOrbit');\n  function syncButtons(){\n    bSpin.classList.toggle('on', spinOn);\n    bOrbit.classList.toggle('on', orbitOn);\n  }\n  bSpin.addEventListener('click', function(){ spinOn=!spinOn; syncButtons(); });\n  bOrbit.addEventListener('click', function(){ orbitOn=!orbitOn; syncButtons(); });\n  document.getElementById('btnPrev').addEventListener('click', function(){ setStage(stageIdx-1); });\n  document.getElementById('btnNext').addEventListener('click', function(){ setStage(stageIdx+1); });\n\n  function setStage(i){\n    stageIdx = Math.max(0, Math.min(stages.length-1, i));\n    document.getElementById('stageNum').textContent = stageIdx+1;\n    document.getElementById('stageName').textContent = stages[stageIdx].name;\n    var items = document.querySelectorAll('#stageList li');\n    for (var q=0;q<items.length;q++){\n      items[q].style.color = q===stageIdx ? '#e8a33d' : '#dfe4ec';\n      items[q].style.fontWeight = q===stageIdx ? '600' : '400';\n    }\n  }\n  setStage(0);\n  syncButtons();\n  requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
